    "body": "The current default is too small for a real use case. Bump it to 262144, which should be comfortably above the normal workload. Add a tuning instruction in its docstring, so user knows what we expect them to do with it.\r\n\r\nThe memory footprint is small (1,048,576 entries cost 139.5 MiB). So for now, it is a reasonable tradeoff to keep our codebase simple.",
